{"id":542545674,"iid":1147,"project_id":45169372,"title":"Add ikos-conc (SV-COMP 2027)","description":"This MR adds data/ikos-conc.yml, the FM-Tools entry for the tool ikos-conc, submitted to SV-COMP 2027.\n\n- Tool: ikos-conc is a static verifier for data races in concurrent C programs, built on the IKOS framework (LLVM-based) using thread-modular analysis (lockset + happens-before).\n- Archive: publicly available at Zenodo (DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.23122650), self-contained, license NASA-1.3.\n- The archive contains LICENSE, README, and smoketest.sh; smoketest.sh runs the tool on bundled examples and exits 0.\n- Jury member: Ronghui Ruan (National University of Defense Technology), contributing designer/developer.\n- Intended participation: SV-COMP 2027 category C.no-data-race.Concurrency (category-structure MR will follow).\n- The tool is not a meta-verifier and does not use LLM/AI.","state":"opened","created_at":"2026-10-03T16:36:33.589Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T11:22:02.427Z","merged_by":null,"merge_user":null,"merged_at":null,"closed_by":null,"closed_at":null,"target_branch":"main","source_branch":"main","user_notes_count":1,"upvotes":0,"downvotes":0,"author":{"id":43004306,"username":"ruanronghui","public_email":null,"name":"ruan ronghgui","state":"active","locked":false,"avatar_url":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e20c772145840a5dc5b42d655127a9559fc335cd330df0ed11e7d5314984bb6b?s=80\u0026d=identicon","web_url":"https://gitlab.com/ruanronghui","bot":false},"assignees":[],"assignee":null,"reviewers":[],"source_project_id":87199605,"target_project_id":45169372,"labels":[],"draft":false,"imported":false,"imported_from":"none","work_in_progress":false,"milestone":null,"merge_when_pipeline_succeeds":false,"merge_status":"can_be_merged","detailed_merge_status":"ci_must_pass","merge_after":null,"sha":"44642d7e451e4350112482c1a5399f9715125d78","merge_commit_sha":null,"squash_commit_sha":null,"discussion_locked":null,"should_remove_source_branch":null,"force_remove_so